# deploy/requirements-tools.in - input for requirements-tools.lock: the Python recon
# tools the active-scanner image runs, kept in their OWN virtualenv (/opt/venv-tools)
# so their dependency trees can never conflict with SpiderFoot's application venv.
#
# Dropped from the old list, deliberately (see deploy/README.md "Active-scanner tools"):
#   trufflehog - PyPI's `trufflehog` is the abandoned 2021 v2.1.13; the maintained v3 is
#                a Go binary, installed from a checksummed release instead.
#   linkfinder - no release in 2.5 years; katana (-jc) does JavaScript endpoint discovery.
dnstwist
snallygaster
wafw00f
arjun
sslyze
